1 polymer     man 'Soluble cytochrome b562,Mu-type opioid receptor,Mu-type opioid receptor'             51321.855 1 ? 
M7W,H102I,R106L,R106 ? 
;N-terminal residues (M1-G63) of MOR were replaced with the thermostabilized apocytochrome b562RIL from Escherichia coli (M7W, H102I and R106L) (BRIL) protein and a linker sequence (GSPGARSAS). C-terminal residues (Q363-P400) of MOR were truncated.,N-terminal residues (M1-G63) of MOR were replaced with the thermostabilized apocytochrome b562RIL from Escherichia coli (M7W, H102I and R106L) (BRIL) protein and a linker sequence (GSPGARSAS). C-terminal residues (Q363-P400) of MOR were truncated.
;
